s, Dai's dream is to grow up to be a hero. He gets to become one when Hadlar is resurrected and the previous hero, Avan, comes to train Dai to help in the battle. But Hadlar, announcing that he now works for an even more powerful demon lord, comes to kill Avan. To save his students Avan uses a Self-Sacrifice spell to attack, but is unable to defeat Hadlar. When it seems that Dai and Avan's other student Pop are doomed a mark appears on Dai's forehead and he suddenly gains super powers and is able to fend off Hadlar. The two students then go off on a journey to avenge Avan and bring peace back to the world.\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"},"tags":[{"name":"Demons","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Magic","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shounen","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Cultivation","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Martial Arts","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Swordplay","rank":60,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Dragon Quest: Dai no Daibouken","english":null,"native":"ドラゴンクエスト ダイの大冒険","romaji":"Dragon Quest: Dai no Daibouken","synonyms":[{"language":"ja","source":"bangumi","value":"DRAGON QUEST -ダイの大冒険-"},{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"神龙之谜"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"龙之谜"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"勇者斗恶龙 达尔的大冒险"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"ドラゴンクエスト・ダイの大冒険"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Dragon Quest: Dai no Daiboken"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}